-- EmailTemplate — a reusable email template. Three flat String fields:
-- slug, subject, body. Smallest entity in the Phase 3d batch.
--
-- Static rows: none. Identity (label / description / icon) is
-- registered by defineSystemEntity on the TS side.
--
-- Phase 3d of the system-entities sweep — see
-- workstreams/ts-elimination/briefs/phase-3d-system-entities-wholesale-flip.md.
-- All three field labels humanize cleanly ("Slug" / "Subject" / "Body").

@entity
@codeName "email_template"
@label "Email Template"
@description "A reusable email template"
@icon "mail"
EmailTemplate = EmailTemplate slug: String subject: String body: String
